	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Nuntius iste habet literas a senatu nostro ad vestrum nomine meo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Obsecro te atque alios omnes obsistite ne iniuria coepta contra me <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sortiatur effectum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">iste tibi narrabit omnia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Narrat vobis omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>suis literis <persName ref="p8033">Theodorus Beza</persName> cuius maxime interest.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Quid actum sit a senatu <placeName ref="l378">Parisiensi</placeName> iste nomine <persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName> tibi <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>narraturus est unde letemini omnes vos: qui usque adeo occupatu<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>s in scribendis literis ad <placeName ref="l832">Gallos</placeName> nostros, ut non licuerit ei <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ad te scribere.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Dominus Iesus cum spiritu tuo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevae</placeName>, cal. iulii 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Tuus ex animo amicus frater <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><persName ref="p8102">R. Stephanus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Concept von der Hand <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName>:]</note>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Quidam ex numero ministrorum preteriti anni mense sept<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>. condemnatus est ante 6 septimanas ad ignem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Parlamentum suis (?) subscribere debuit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Plures noluere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Rex tamen scire volen<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>s audivit ex parlamento non <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>postremum, qui tamen nuntium sic ornavit et defendit, ut rex <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>querimoniis recalcitratus tandem tamen dixerit, se de hoc negotio <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>diligentius cogitaturum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Quidam <placeName ref="l167">Geneve</placeName> <persName>Barbürinus</persName>, si nomen recte teneo, suis impensis curat annot.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><persName ref="p8033">Beze</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">In novum test. ex<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>audi per <persName ref="p1283">Gessnerum</persName> nostrum, quam ob causam per ostidium(?) detentus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>est in <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>vinculis(?) ... ea lege dimissus, ut iubeat <persName ref="p1283">Gess.</persName> subsistere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ea de re fecit ille litteras magistratus ad <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ampliss. senatum meum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
